# From "Explore Total Self" (Wave VII - Voyager, CD1-1): contacting the
# Inner Helper at Focus 21, and a formal set of questions to ask it. Assumes
# F21 already reached.

@segment  explore-total-self
@title    Explore Total Self — The Inner Helper
@levels   F21
@duration ~5m

say From here, reach in and ask for help — from the one within you who is your closest friend. The one who knows and understands you better than you realize. Your inner helper.
pause 8
say Keep stating your desire to meet and know this greater part of yourself, calmly and easily, until contact is made and communication begins.
hold 30
say Ask your inner helper: what is the relationship between the two of us?
pause 10
say Ask how your inner helper came into being.
pause 10
say Ask about any physical lifetimes this part of you may have lived.
pause 10
say Ask how many physical lifetimes you yourself have lived.
pause 10
say Ask what the three most important of those lifetimes have been.
pause 10
say Ask what the purpose is, of living a physical human life here, in earth, time, and space.
pause 10
say Ask what your own goal is, in living this physical life.
pause 10
say Ask how you can best achieve it.
pause 10
say Give thanks for what you've received. Release your inner helper for now, and close down the communication — with gratitude for the help and cooperation.
pause 8
say State that you'll resume again soon.
pause 6
